Tanqeeb Job Market Analysis Dashboard
Overview

This project analyzes job market trends using data collected from the Tanqeeb job portal. The dashboard provides insights into hiring patterns, job categories, company demand, and location-based opportunities.

Objectives
Analyze job postings across industries.
Identify in-demand skills and roles.
Evaluate hiring trends by location.
Support career and recruitment decision-making.
Key Metrics
Total Job Postings
Top Hiring Companies
Most In-Demand Skills
Jobs by Location
Jobs by Industry
Dashboard Features
Job distribution analysis
Industry-wise hiring trends
Location-based opportunity analysis
Skill demand visualization
Interactive filtering capabilities
